    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Monitor for containers support for <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Faks-engine&amp;data=02%7C01%7Ckeikhara%40microsoft.com%7Cf6116f6e8048432ade8608d682446a80%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636839627685310239&amp;sdata=%2FPeqnxhDaQnZhGBlvkPbJMVGD%2FcJuV2%2B7nQmPW31R6g%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AKS-engine</a> is now available in public preview. Customers can now monitor both Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) and AKS-engine by using Azure Monitor for containers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can get started <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FMicrosoft%2FOMS-docker%2Ftree%2Faks-engine%23trying-the-azure-monitor-for-containers-for-aks-engine-clusters&amp;data=02%7C01%7Ckeikhara%40microsoft.com%7Cf6116f6e8048432ade8608d682446a80%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636839627685310239&amp;sdata=qDo4yRQqQ5pgeutiO5XripTK8RatHrki1RrnINojTHE%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">get started</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FMicrosoft%2FOMS-docker%2Ftree%2Faks-engine%23supportability&amp;data=02%7C01%7Ckeikhara%40microsoft.com%7Cf6116f6e8048432ade8608d682446a80%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636839627685320248&amp;sdata=zJE709ygQ6oUYsqQKgzbKTkOzWwrpjtjYItU7IUZ%2B2k%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">learn about supportability</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Monitor for containers support for AKS-engine is now available in public preview. Customers can now monitor both Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) and AKS-engine by using Azure Monitor for containers.\n\nYou can get started get started and learn about supportability ."
  },
